      "about_home": "Lives in the forest, nesting in burrows under tree roots and logs. It runs along hidden paths in the moss.",
      "about_winter": "Stays awake all winter in tunnels under the snow, where it's warmer than on top.",
      "about_young": "Up to four families a year, each of 3\u20136 young. Young born in spring can have their own young by summer.",
      "about_fact": "Foxes, kestrels and owls all live mostly on voles. When voles are many, those hunters raise more young.",
